{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/agent/edit_result_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:11:28.968517Z","id":"24c101ecb8a7552b18b05207fde9d6b95df982b6922f2f0384c35d87deeb3417","body":{"detail":"The walk checks additionalProperties: false and required == properties on every object. The Messages API also refuses minLength/maxLength, minimum/maximum/multipleOf, minItems other than 0 or 1, maxItems, and formats outside its list, and caps parameters with union types (anyOf or type arrays) at 16 and optional parameters at 24 per request. editSchema meets all of these today (three anyOf parameters, none optional); a test that allows only the supported keywords and counts anyOf nodes would stop a later edit (for example a maxLength on path) from making every Messages API request a 400.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":292},"end":{"line":320},"content_hash":"d65309e1d238e1a7ca47e7e6e5a890848cd2f7e31599203d51d22635841022ce"},"summary":"Pin the schema to the structured-outputs subset, not only additionalProperties and required","tags":["review","tests","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
